  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The number of ions will be precipitated only which are out of coordination sphere in given complexes.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Cr</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>]</mo><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8644;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>Cr</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8201;3</mtext><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>AgCl</mi><mo>&#8595;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi>White</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />More Equivalents of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> aqueous solution will be consumed by more <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions given by the complex<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>&#8595;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
